<title>JAPAN: Indonesia Apr Minas calculated at $18.28 - traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Apr Minas calculated at $18.28 - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for April lifting was calculated at $18.28 per barrel, down 96 cents from March, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Prices of other grades are as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		  APRIL	   MARCH</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  18.81	   19.91</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	18.98	   20.00</p>
<p> Attaka		   19.59	   20.77</p>
<p> Cinta		    17.51	   18.52</p>
<p> Duri		     16.62	   17.63</p>
<p> Handil		   18.28	   19.32</p>
<p> Lalang		   18.33	   19.19</p>
<p> Widuri		   17.41	   18.39</p>
<p> Belida		   19.61	   20.83</p>
<p> Anoa		     19.99	   22.65</p>
<p> Badak		    19.59	   20.77</p>
<p> Bekapai		  19.59	   20.77</p>
<p> Bunyu		    17.98	   19.54</p>
<p> Jatibarang	     17.27	   20.25</p>
<p> Bontang Mix	    18.78	   19.80</p>
<p> Walio		    18.08	   19.44</p>
